 R←Test_Misc_002(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;version;date;filename;notes
⍝ Checks that the version reported by `Version` has made it into ReleaseNotes.md
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 (version date)←1↓##.Plodder.Version
 version←version↑⍨¯1+⌊/version⍳'-+'      ⍝ Drop pre-release and build ID: 1.2.3-beta-1+456 → 1.2.3

 filename←##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/ReleaseNotes.md'
 →T.PassesIf ⎕NEXISTS filename

 notes←⊃⎕NGET filename 1
 →T.PassesIf 1=+/∨/¨('## ',version,' from')∘⍷¨notes          ⍝ There is a section for this version
 →T.PassesIf 1=+/∨/¨('## ',version,' from ',date)∘⍷¨notes    ⍝ ... and it carries the release date

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
